OL,5,G1800 GPs: Behind Closed Doors          
OL,6,     FNew series of the observational   
OL,7,     Fdocumentary series filmed inside a
OL,8,     Fworking general practice. The     
OL,9,     Fseries moves to Bristol as we see 
OL,10,     Fwhat it's like to work for, and   
OL,11,     Fuse, the NHS.                     
